From: T3chnobone <98963290+T3chnobone@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 10:37:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Couch Party / LAN: 1P-style HUD for every player, place
 number bottom left

- Each player's view has its own 1P HUD layout: minimap, speedometer or
  race positions in the bottom right. Each player cycles their own view
  with their own C-right (right stick right by default), like 1 player.
  Before, only player 1 could switch, and it switched every view.
- Each speedometer needle follows its own player's kart, not player 1's.
- The race positions column puts the view's own player on top with the
  highlight border.
- The place is a plain number in the bottom left of every player's view,
  like the 4-player VS race (it used to be "3rd" on player 1's view only).
  The ROM only has numbers 1-4, so 5-8 use the digit of the 1P "5th".."8th"
  pictures.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
